---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
import { plot, scale } from '../geometry';
import { pageLang } from '../../../utils/lang';

const ru = pageLang(Astro.url) === 'ru';

const yMax = 5;
const surprise = (p: number) => -Math.log2(p);
const reciprocal = (p: number) => 1 / p;
const rare = { p: 0.1, s: surprise(0.1) };
const common = { p: 0.9, s: surprise(0.9) };
const f3 = (v: number) => v.toFixed(3);
const xTicks = [0, 0.1, 0.5, 0.9, 1];
const yTicks = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5];

// Wide: point labels inside the plot. Narrow: a taller plot, point labels listed below it.
const layouts = {
  w: { vb: '0 0 610 350', cls: 'fig-wide fig-medium', narrow: false, left: 64, right: 540, top: 26, bottom: 292 },
  n: { vb: '0 0 360 420', cls: 'fig-narrow', narrow: true, left: 50, right: 290, top: 30, bottom: 330 },
};
---

<Figure
  id="entropy-and-divergences-surprise-curve"
  title={ru ? "У достоверного исхода неожиданность должна быть нулевой" : "Surprise must vanish for a certain outcome"}
  caption={ru ? "Первая попытка, 1/P(x), правильно упорядочивает редкие исходы, но при P(x) = 1 всё ещё равна 1. Логарифм переносит эту точку в ноль. Неожиданность −log₂ P(x) измеряется в битах, у 1/P(x) единицы измерения нет. Две отмеченные точки — вероятности 0.1 и 0.9 из примера с несимметричной монетой ниже." : "The first attempt, 1/P(x), ranks rare outcomes correctly but still equals 1 when P(x) = 1. Taking the logarithm moves that point to zero. Surprise −log₂ P(x) is in bits; 1/P(x) has no unit. The two marked points are the probabilities 0.1 and 0.9 used in the biased-coin example below."}
>
  {Object.entries(layouts).map(([sfx, L]) => {
    const sx = scale([0, 1], [L.left, L.right]);
    const sy = scale([0, yMax], [L.bottom, L.top]);
    // Clip both curves to the plot area so steep parts do not spill over the labels.
    const surprisePath = plot(surprise, 1 / 2 ** yMax, 1, sx, sy, 240);
    const reciprocalPath = plot(reciprocal, 1 / yMax, 1, sx, sy, 200);
    const id = `entropy-and-divergences-surprise-curve-${sfx}`;
    return (
      <svg class={L.cls} viewBox={L.vb} role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-t ${id}-d`}>
        <title id={`${id}-t`}>{ru ? "Неожиданность как функция вероятности" : "Surprise as a function of probability"}</title>
        <desc id={`${id}-d`}>{ru ? `Две убывающие кривые на отрезке вероятностей от 0 до 1. Пунктирная кривая 1 / P(x) заканчивается на высоте 1 при P(x) = 1. Сплошная кривая минус логарифм по основанию 2 от P(x) заканчивается в нуле, отмеченном как отсутствие неожиданности. Точки отмечают вероятность 0.9 с неожиданностью ${f3(common.s)} бита и вероятность 0.1 с неожиданностью ${f3(rare.s)} бита.` : `Two decreasing curves over probability from 0 to 1. The dashed curve 1 over P(x) ends at height 1 when P(x) equals 1. The solid curve minus log base 2 of P(x) ends at zero, marked as no surprise. Points mark probability 0.9 with surprise ${f3(common.s)} bits and probability 0.1 with surprise ${f3(rare.s)} bits.`}</desc>

        {yTicks.map((tick) => <line class="f-grid" x1={L.left} x2={L.right} y1={sy(tick)} y2={sy(tick)} />)}
        {yTicks.map((tick) => <text class="f-note" x={L.left - (L.narrow ? 10 : 12)} y={sy(tick) + 5} text-anchor="end">{tick}</text>)}
        {xTicks.map((tick) => <text class="f-note" x={sx(tick)} y={L.bottom + 22} text-anchor="middle">{tick}</text>)}
        <path class="f-axis" d={`M ${L.left} ${L.bottom} H ${L.right + 30}`} marker-end="url(#f-arrow-muted)" />
        <path class="f-axis" d={`M ${L.left} ${L.bottom} V ${L.top - 10}`} marker-end="url(#f-arrow-muted)" />
        <text class="f-math" x={L.right + 30} y={L.bottom + 44} text-anchor="end">P(x)</text>
        <text class="f-label" transform={`translate(${L.left - (L.narrow ? 34 : 42)} ${(L.top + L.bottom) / 2}) rotate(-90)`} text-anchor="middle">{ru ? 'неожиданность' : 'surprise'}</text>

        <path class="f-line f-muted f-dash" d={reciprocalPath} />
        <path class="f-line f-blue f-bold" d={surprisePath} />

        <text class="f-math f-t-muted" x={sx(0.42)} y={sy(2.75)}>1 / P(x)</text>
        <text class="f-math f-t-blue" x={sx(L.narrow ? 0.14 : 0.2)} y={sy(L.narrow ? 0.5 : 1.12)}>−log₂ P(x)</text>

        {/* The two marked probabilities */}
        <line class="f-thin f-muted f-dash" x1={sx(rare.p)} x2={sx(rare.p)} y1={L.bottom} y2={sy(rare.s)} />
        <circle class="f-solid-blue" cx={sx(rare.p)} cy={sy(rare.s)} r="5" />
        <circle class="f-solid-blue" cx={sx(common.p)} cy={sy(common.s)} r="5" />
        {L.narrow ? (
          <g>
            <circle class="f-solid-blue" cx={L.left - 30} cy={L.bottom + 61} r="5" />
            <text class="f-label" x={L.left - 18} y={L.bottom + 66}>P = 0.1: {f3(rare.s)} {ru ? 'бита' : 'bits'};  P = 0.9: {f3(common.s)} {ru ? 'бита' : 'bits'}</text>
          </g>
        ) : (
          <g>
            <text class="f-label" x={sx(0.33)} y={sy(4.55)}>P = 0.1: {f3(rare.s)} {ru ? 'бита' : 'bits'}</text>
            <path class="f-thin" d={`M ${sx(0.32)} ${sy(4.62)} Q ${sx(0.17)} ${sy(4.75)} ${sx(rare.p) + 8} ${sy(rare.s) - 7}`} marker-end="url(#f-arrow)" />
            <text class="f-label" x={sx(0.43)} y={sy(0.1)}>P = 0.9: {f3(common.s)} {ru ? 'бита' : 'bits'}</text>
            <path class="f-thin" d={`M ${sx(0.73)} ${sy(0.18)} Q ${sx(0.82)} ${sy(0.3)} ${sx(common.p) - 8} ${sy(common.s)}`} marker-end="url(#f-arrow)" />
          </g>
        )}

        {/* The key property: zero surprise at P = 1, while 1/P stays at 1 */}
        <circle class="f-line f-red" cx={sx(1)} cy={sy(0)} r="11" />
        {L.narrow ? (
          <g>
            <text class="f-label f-t-red" x={sx(0.5)} y={sy(4.05)}>{ru ? "нет неожиданности" : "no surprise"}</text>
            <text class="f-label f-t-red" x={sx(0.5)} y={sy(3.7)}>{ru ? "при P(x) = 1" : "when P(x) = 1"}</text>
            <path class="f-line f-red" d={`M ${sx(0.9)} ${sy(3.5)} Q ${sx(1.03)} ${sy(2)} ${sx(1) + 3} ${sy(0) - 14}`} marker-end="url(#f-arrow-red)" />
          </g>
        ) : (
          <g>
            <text class="f-label f-t-red" x={sx(0.62)} y={sy(2.55)}>{ru ? "нет неожиданности при P(x) = 1" : "no surprise when P(x) = 1"}</text>
            <path class="f-line f-red" d={`M ${sx(0.86)} ${sy(2.38)} Q ${sx(1.03)} ${sy(1.6)} ${sx(1) + 3} ${sy(0) - 14}`} marker-end="url(#f-arrow-red)" />
          </g>
        )}
        <circle class="f-solid-muted" cx={sx(1)} cy={sy(1)} r="4" />
        <text class="f-note" x={sx(1) + 10} y={sy(1) - 8}>1/P = 1</text>
      </svg>
    );
  })}
</Figure>
